The company was founded in 2014 and is based in Madrid with a team of 21 professionals completely specialized in drone technology.

Alpha&rsquo;s international clients include the worlds largest defense companies who use its systems particularly for border control and maritime surveillance. International sales have been made directly from Alpha to end-users and through international sales agents.

Due to the regulatory framework, Alpha is committed to designing and manufacturing drones that weigh under 25kg, that are reliable, versatile and &ldquo;weather-proof.&rdquo;
